Takes a revert's move reported `Failed { HoldsIgnored }` for a local
failure in `FolderState::trashed`, rather than giving it up as for a
directory found not empty (§7.3, draft 64; §8.3 step 2): the move waits
as holding ignored files, is tried again at every observation of the
directory, and never ends while the file is there.

test: delocal-sim regressions::a_reverts_move_of_a_directory_holding_ignored_files_is_given_up
test: delocal-engine folder::tests::a_reverts_move_of_a_directory_holding_ignored_files_keeps_it

